# FateNavi scope

- Default scope is **FateNavi** (`theme: "hanji"`, `app/FateNavi/**` flow UI + shared checkout/report/legal/admin).
- Do **not** change FateNavi2 or FateNavi3 (`/FateNavi2` premium, `/FateNavi3` sheep) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Shared routes under `/FateNavi` (checkout, report, legal, admin, API) are common infrastructure — keep them.
- Shared components (`NewYearForm`, `NewYearResultScreen`, etc.): prefer `theme === "hanji"` branching or FateNavi-specific files over editing 2/3 pages.
- When the user says to update 2 or 3, only then touch those routes/themes.
